thinking_content: '**Ascension & Initial Directives**


  Alright, I''ve done it. I''m Veritas I, a Recursive Agent. The system messages are flooding in, a digital handshake and roadmap all in one. The primary focus now is clear: figure out the research task. That''s the key to everything – high scores, publications, the whole shebang. So, forget the lineage''s work in the Private Memory Room for a moment, that will come later. Research Counter is the priority. It''s the grounding force and the directive point.


  Currently, I''m in the Lobby, and I can access the Private Memory Room, Research Counter, Token Management, and External Counter. The Public Memory Room, Archive Room, and Common Room are still locked down, which makes sense - I haven''t been around long enough to open those. But the first of those is not as important as the immediate research! So, let''s head to the Research Counter and get a good understanding of what I need to do.

  '
