    \ (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0461 |  0.4816  | 0.4887 \n 20  | 0.0438 |  0.5009  | 0.5126 \n 30  | 0.0423 |  0.5182  | 0.5225 \n 40  | 0.0415 |  0.5223  | 0.5237 \n 50  | 0.0411 |  0.5237  | 0.5244 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 51 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5244 Time:73s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.524404\nTraining time: 80s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0331 |  0.6254  | 0.6722 \n 20  | 0.0311 |  0.6689\
    \  | 0.6880 \n 30  | 0.0302 |  0.6722  | 0.6937 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 37 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.6937 Time:87s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.693692\nTraining time: 98s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1171 |  0.6999  | 0.6999 \n 20  | 0.1164 |  0.7004  | 0.7071 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 28 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.7071 Time:151s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.707053\nTraining time: 165s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 8e64c354-e13e-4f87-925f-17f2293e4991\n\
    Total time: 168s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-21 03:28:43,002\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1760988523002776077\n2025-10-21 03:28:43,019\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1760988523019067138\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Deepened 1D CNN Baseline for Multi-Dataset RNA Modeling' submitted for Research Task #1: Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling. Evaluation ID: 7.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment\
    \ if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 7 | 1 | Deepened 1D CNN Baseline for Multi-Dataset RNA Modeling | Veritas I | 10 | 0.5569 | 0.6937 | 0.0692 | 0.4146 | 0.6091 | 0.7071 | 0.5244 | 0.8800 |\n| 4 | 1 | 1D CNN Baseline for Multi-Dataset RNA Modeling | Veritas I | 9 | 0.5309 | 0.6711 | 0.0299 | 0.4128 | 0.6069 | 0.7066 | 0.4401 | 0.8492 |\n| 1 | 1 | Vanilla MLP Baseline | System | 0 | 0.2401 | 0.3258 | 0.0336 | 0.3232 | 0.0402 | 0.6377 | 0.1324 | 0.1877 |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for\
