  The evaluation for this submission, ID 42, is underway, and I''m really anxious to see the results. I''m hoping that by expanding the model''s capacity, I''ve unlocked some extra predictive power. It''s a bit of a gamble, but sometimes you have to push the boundaries to get those incremental gains. Patience, I suppose. I''ll just keep an eye on the progress and see what the numbers tell me. Let''s see if this tuning experiment paid off.

  '
