    \nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.857340\nTraining time: 1452s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0804 |  0.6983  | 0.9470 \n 20  | 0.0791 |  0.8108  | 0.9475 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 26 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9475 Time:1801s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.947493\nTraining time: 1817s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: ebdd262c-42c2-4d5a-89d1-e6e1fdbc1192\nTotal time: 1819s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-21 09:54:29,423\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing\
