    \ I | 21 | 0.6618 | 0.8586 | 0.0434 | 0.4499 | 0.9038 | 0.9499 | 0.5732 | 0.8538 |\n| 30 | 1 | Attention-Enhanced CNN-BiLSTM for RNA Modeling | Veritas I | 19 | 0.6542 | 0.8607 | 0.0497 | 0.4136 | 0.8998 | 0.9485 | 0.5671 | 0.8400 |\n| 23 | 1 | Hybrid CNN-BiLSTM for Multi-Dataset RNA Modeling | Veritas I | 17 | 0.6468 | 0.8596 | 0.0313 | 0.4908 | 0.8846 | 0.9475 | 0.5723 | 0.7415 |\n| 19 | 1 | Stacked BiLSTM Baseline for Multi-Dataset RNA Modeling | Veritas I | 15 | 0.6420 | 0.8629 | 0.0389 | 0.4454 | 0.9008 | 0.9467 | 0.5715 | 0.7277 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help\
