    \ Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761020159290999936\n2025-10-21 12:16:03,651\tERROR tune_controller.py:1331 -- Trial task failed for trial rna_trainable_a5e82_00001\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/ray/air/execution/_internal/event_manager.py\", line 110, in resolve_future\n    result = ray.get(future)\n             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/ray/_private/auto_init_hook.py\", line 22, in auto_init_wrapper\n    return fn(*args, **kwargs)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/ray/_private/client_mode_hook.py\", line 104, in wrapper\n    return func(*args, **kwargs)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/ray/_private/worker.py\", line 2858, in get\n    values, debugger_breakpoint = worker.get_objects(object_refs,\
