    \ | 0.8946 | 0.9489 | 0.5683 | 0.9062 |\n| 51 | 1 | Refined Hybrid CNN-BiLSTM with Additive Attention (Increased Dense Capacity) | Veritas I | 27 | 0.6738 | 0.8558 | 0.0580 | 0.4905 | 0.9053 | 0.9443 | 0.5673 | 0.8954 |\n| 46 | 1 | Hybrid Pooling CNN-BiLSTM with Additive Attention & Max Pooling | Veritas I | 25 | 0.6582 | 0.8115 | 0.0399 | 0.4682 | 0.8679 | 0.9496 | 0.5658 | 0.9046 |\n| 42 | 1 | Tuned Hybrid CNN-BiLSTM with Additive Attention Pooling | Veritas I | 23 | 0.6724 | 0.8635 | 0.0452 | 0.4831 | 0.8998 | 0.9498 | 0.5743 | 0.8908 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help\
