    \ regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0154 |  0.8469  | 0.8469 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 19\n=============================================\nBest:0.8538 Time:1846s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.853821\nTraining time: 1860s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 3cd86f0d-0d90-476e-b978-5dc0d646a426\nTotal time: 1916s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-21 13:56:12,990\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761026172990693471\n2025-10-21 13:56:13,005\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761026173005136369\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo\
