    \ |\n| 87 | 1 | Positional Encoded Residual CNN-BiLSTM with Additive Attention (Fixed) | Veritas I | 43 | 0.6636 | 0.8544 | 0.0343 | 0.4855 | 0.8686 | 0.9505 | 0.5630 | 0.8892 |\n| 85 | 1 | Positional Encoded Residual CNN-BiLSTM with Additive Attention | Veritas I | 41 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 82 | 1 | Gated CNN-BiLSTM with Additive Attention Pooling | Veritas I | 39 | 0.6719 | 0.8559 | 0.0393 | 0.5131 | 0.8872 | 0.9470 | 0.5655 | 0.8954 |\n| 77 | 1 | Residual CNN-BiLSTM with Additive Attention Pooling | Veritas I | 37 | 0.6771 | 0.8626 | 0.0591 | 0.4806 | 0.8988 | 0.9499 | 0.5608 | 0.9277 |\n| 72 | 1 | Task-Specific Head CNN-BiLSTM with Additive Attention | Veritas I | 35 | 0.6675 | 0.8595 | 0.0576 | 0.4337 | 0.9009 | 0.9493 | 0.5685 | 0.9031 |\n| 67 | 1 | Adaptive CNN Kernel Hybrid CNN-BiLSTM with Additive Attention | Veritas I | 33 | 0.6644 | 0.8573 | 0.0777 | 0.4349 | 0.8974 | 0.9475 | 0.5647 | 0.8708 |\n| 64 | 1 | Tuned CNN-BiLSTM with Additive\
    \ Attention (Reduced CNN Kernel) | Veritas I | 31 | 0.6668 | 0.8630 | 0.0648 | 0.4345 | 0.9034 | 0.9502 | 0.5564 | 0.8954 |\n| 57 | 1 | Multi-Head Additive Attention CNN-BiLSTM for RNA Modeling | Veritas I | 29 | 0.6697 | 0.8593 | 0.0340 | 0.4769 | 0.8946 | 0.9489 | 0.5683 | 0.9062 |\n\nPage 1 of 3 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-3, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}`\
