    \ 1 | No-PE + Concat MHA + Low-Rank Bilinear Pooling (r=8) | Noema I | 48 | 0.6699 | 0.8591 | 0.0605 | 0.4573 | 0.8869 | 0.9517 | 0.5586 | 0.9154 |\n| 95 | 1 | No-PE + Concat MHA + Offset Correlation Pooling | Noema I | 47 | 0.6627 | 0.8535 | 0.0320 | 0.4589 | 0.8780 | 0.9531 | 0.5646 | 0.8985 |\n\nPage 1 of 11 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-11, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}`\
