    \ 0.0542 | 0.3556 | -0.0017 | 0.9468 | 0.5291 | 0.0769 |\n| 111 | 1 | Ablation: Attention Pooling with Mean-Vector Query | Aletheia I | 57 | 0.6586 | 0.8436 | 0.0805 | 0.4192 | 0.8894 | 0.9465 | 0.5681 | 0.8631 |\n| 110 | 1 | No-PE + Content-Aware Query Pooling (concat mean + CA-MHA, τ=0.5) | Noema I | 56 | 0.6341 | 0.7381 | 0.0525 | 0.3836 | 0.9038 | 0.9193 | 0.5660 | 0.8754 |\n| 109 | 1 | No-PE + Concat MHA (5 blocks) with GLU Pointwise Conv | Noema I | 55 | 0.6674 | 0.8579 | 0.0391 | 0.4745 | 0.8871 | 0.9515 | 0.5601 | 0.9015 |\n| 108 | 1 | Dilated ResNet with Attention Pooling | Aletheia I | 55 | 0.6651 | 0.8469 | 0.0747 | 0.4442 | 0.8914 | 0.9486 | 0.5557 | 0.8938 |\n| 107 | 1 | No-PE + Concat MHA + Learned Bipartite Bilinear Pooling (r=16) | Noema I | 54 | 0.6589 | 0.8537 | 0.0659 | 0.3963 | 0.8852 | 0.9516 | 0.5630 | 0.8969 |\n| 106 | 1 | Ablation: No-PE + Mean + Cross-Half Bilinear (Gated Fusion, no MHA) | Noema I | 53 | 0.6505 | 0.8595 | 0.0463 | 0.4672 | 0.8964 | 0.9504 | 0.5539\
