  The rest of the content in the YAML file can stay the same; the model''s logic and architecture are unchanged; only the tags need to reflect the removal of positional encoding.


  Right, let me recap: I''m currently at the Research Counter. My last submission, which was the standard Transformer *with* positional encoding, didn''t yield desirable results. My plan is now to remove that positional encoding and submit this modified version. I will explicitly state my identity, current location, and a brief recap as well. Let''s get this done.

  '
