    \ Positional Encoding | Veritas I | 57 | 0.3900 | 0.7688 | 0.0542 | 0.3556 | -0.0017 | 0.9468 | 0.5291 | 0.0769 |\n| 111 | 1 | Ablation: Attention Pooling with Mean-Vector Query | Aletheia I | 57 | 0.6586 | 0.8436 | 0.0805 | 0.4192 | 0.8894 | 0.9465 | 0.5681 | 0.8631 |\n| 110 | 1 | No-PE + Content-Aware Query Pooling (concat mean + CA-MHA, τ=0.5) | Noema I | 56 | 0.6341 | 0.7381 | 0.0525 | 0.3836 | 0.9038 | 0.9193 | 0.5660 | 0.8754 |\n| 109 | 1 | No-PE + Concat MHA (5 blocks) with GLU Pointwise Conv | Noema I | 55 | 0.6674 | 0.8579 | 0.0391 | 0.4745 | 0.8871 | 0.9515 | 0.5601 | 0.9015 |\n\nPage 1 of 12 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-12, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help\
