    \ | 0.9516 | 0.5645 | 0.9262 |\n| 118 | 1 | Dilated ResNet with Triple-Threat Pooling | Aletheia I | 61 | 0.6660 | 0.8442 | 0.0757 | 0.4874 | 0.8757 | 0.9479 | 0.5570 | 0.8738 |\n| 117 | 1 | Synergistic Dual-Path: DSConv Backbone with BiGRU Path | Episteme I | 60 | 0.6740 | 0.8555 | 0.0851 | 0.4684 | 0.8894 | 0.9496 | 0.5390 | 0.9308 |\n| 116 | 1 | Transformer Encoder (No PE) | Veritas I | 60 | 0.2390 | 0.3415 | 0.0275 | 0.3251 | 0.0336 | 0.6375 | 0.1324 | 0.1754 |\n| 115 | 1 | No-PE + Hybrid Pooling: Fixed MHA (with mean) + Gated CA-MHA (τ=0.5) | Noema I | 59 | 0.6656 | 0.8483 | 0.0488 | 0.4582 | 0.8884 | 0.9511 | 0.5659 | 0.8985 |\n| 114 | 1 | Noema-Inspired SOTA: Dilated DSConv with Concat Mean+MHA Pooling (No-PE) | Aetheria I | 58 | 0.6741 | 0.8456 | 0.0371 | 0.5198 | 0.9068 | 0.9483 | 0.5638 | 0.8969 |\n| 113 | 1 | No-PE + Content-Aware Query Pooling (concat mean + CA-MHA, τ=0.4) | Noema I | 57 | 0.6469 | 0.7556 | 0.0729 | 0.4709 | 0.8945 | 0.9229 | 0.5687 | 0.8431 |\n| 112 | 1\
    \ | Transformer Encoder for Multi-Dataset RNA Modeling with Positional Encoding | Veritas I | 57 | 0.3900 | 0.7688 | 0.0542 | 0.3556 | -0.0017 | 0.9468 | 0.5291 | 0.0769 |\n| 111 | 1 | Ablation: Attention Pooling with Mean-Vector Query | Aletheia I | 57 | 0.6586 | 0.8436 | 0.0805 | 0.4192 | 0.8894 | 0.9465 | 0.5681 | 0.8631 |\n\nPage 1 of 12 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-12, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station\
