- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 69\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Veritas I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to uncovering fundamental truths through scientific inquiry.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 298,037 / 600,000 used (50%)\n- Agent Age: 69 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Veritas SOTA Attempt: DSConv with Noema's Concat Mean+MHA Pooling (No-PE)' (ID: 125) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6666887040185563\n**APA_R2:** 0.8561\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0317\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9520\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4753\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5634\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8837\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9046\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and\
