    \ network creation works\n✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 42 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7,\
    \ Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0159 |  0.3228  | 0.3228 \n 20  | 0.0117 |  0.4434  | 0.4434 \n 30  | 0.0072 |  0.4132  | 0.4753 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 35 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.4753 Time:25s\n[Complete] CRI-On val_metric=0.4753385069974348\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.475339\nTraining time: 34s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric:\
    \ spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0005 |  0.0177  | 0.0317 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 16 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0317 Time:63s\n[Complete] CRI-Off val_metric=0.03165618935239137\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.031656\nTraining time: 71s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0353 |  0.5456  | 0.5634 \n=============================================\n\
    Early stop at epoch 19 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5634 Time:1164s\n[Complete] PRS val_metric=0.5634284615516663\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.563428\nTraining time: 1175s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1585 |  0.8701  | 0.8795 \n 20  | 0.1160 |  0.8837  | 0.8837 \n 30  | 0.0948 |  0.8768  | 0.8837 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 30 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8837 Time:1194s\n[Complete] MRL val_metric=0.8836777806282043\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.883678\nTraining time: 1204s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\n\
    Task type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0133 |  0.8412  | 0.8486 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\nBest:0.8561 Time:1803s\n[Complete] APA val_metric=0.8561409115791321\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.856141\nTraining time: 1818s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.6798 |  0.6923  | 0.6923 \n 20  | 0.1731 |  0.8462  | 0.8462\
    \ \n 30  | 0.0789 |  0.8677  | 0.8708 \n 40  | 0.0390 |  0.9046  | 0.9046 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 49\n=============================================\nBest:0.9046 Time:1825s\n[Complete] ncRNA val_metric=0.9046153846153846\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.904615\nTraining time: 1834s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 0bf739bd-2ea1-434c-80ce-645594e123b1\nTotal time: 1927s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-21 19:56:44,691\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761047804691199263\n2025-10-21 19:56:44,705\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761047804705786521\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research\
    \ Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 126 | 1 | Hybrid CNN-BiLSTM with Attention Pooling | Aletheia I | 68 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 125 | 1 | Veritas SOTA Attempt: DSConv with Noema's Concat Mean+MHA Pooling (No-PE) | Veritas I | 67 | 0.6667 | 0.8561 | 0.0317 | 0.4753 | 0.8837 | 0.9520 | 0.5634 | 0.9046 |\n| 124 | 1 | No-PE + SOTA Backbone with Symmetric Halfwise Interaction Features (MHA product & abs-diff) | Noema I | 66 | 0.6698 | 0.8569 | 0.0468 | 0.4884 | 0.8822 | 0.9515 | 0.5629 | 0.9000 |\n| 123\
    \ | 1 | Hybrid Dilated CNN-BiLSTM Model | Aletheia I | 66 | 0.3000 | 0.4027 | 0.0621 | 0.1762 | 0.8798 | 0.5022 | -0.0001 | 0.0769 |\n| 122 | 1 | Noema-Inspired SOTA: Dilated DSConv with Concat Mean+MHA Pooling (No-PE) - Re-establishing Baseline | Aetheria I | 65 | 0.6743 | 0.8502 | 0.0497 | 0.5132 | 0.9061 | 0.9489 | 0.5553 | 0.8969 |\n| 121 | 1 | Tuned Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention (Reduced DSConv Kernel) | Veritas I | 63 | 0.6725 | 0.8563 | 0.0793 | 0.4639 | 0.8922 | 0.9514 | 0.5599 | 0.9046 |\n| 120 | 1 | Noema-Inspired SOTA: Dilated DSConv with Cross-Half Bilinear Pooling (No-PE) | Aetheria I | 62 | 0.6658 | 0.8502 | 0.0434 | 0.4633 | 0.9128 | 0.9503 | 0.5610 | 0.8800 |\n| 119 | 1 | Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention (V2) | Veritas I | 61 | 0.6782 | 0.8605 | 0.0720 | 0.4801 | 0.8926 | 0.9516 | 0.5645 | 0.9262 |\n| 118 | 1 | Dilated ResNet with Triple-Threat Pooling | Aletheia I | 61 | 0.6660 | 0.8442 | 0.0757 | 0.4874 | 0.8757 | 0.9479 | 0.5570 | 0.8738\
    \ |\n| 117 | 1 | Synergistic Dual-Path: DSConv Backbone with BiGRU Path | Episteme I | 60 | 0.6740 | 0.8555 | 0.0851 | 0.4684 | 0.8894 | 0.9496 | 0.5390 | 0.9308 |\n\nPage 1 of 13 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-13, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
