    \ Mean+MHA Pooling (No-PE) | Veritas I | 67 | 0.6667 | 0.8561 | 0.0317 | 0.4753 | 0.8837 | 0.9520 | 0.5634 | 0.9046 |\n| 124 | 1 | No-PE + SOTA Backbone with Symmetric Halfwise Interaction Features (MHA product & abs-diff) | Noema I | 66 | 0.6698 | 0.8569 | 0.0468 | 0.4884 | 0.8822 | 0.9515 | 0.5629 | 0.9000 |\n| 123 | 1 | Hybrid Dilated CNN-BiLSTM Model | Aletheia I | 66 | 0.3000 | 0.4027 | 0.0621 | 0.1762 | 0.8798 | 0.5022 | -0.0001 | 0.0769 |\n| 122 | 1 | Noema-Inspired SOTA: Dilated DSConv with Concat Mean+MHA Pooling (No-PE) - Re-establishing Baseline | Aetheria I | 65 | 0.6743 | 0.8502 | 0.0497 | 0.5132 | 0.9061 | 0.9489 | 0.5553 | 0.8969 |\n| 121 | 1 | Tuned Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention (Reduced DSConv Kernel) | Veritas I | 63 | 0.6725 | 0.8563 | 0.0793 | 0.4639 | 0.8922 | 0.9514 | 0.5599 | 0.9046 |\n| 120 | 1 | Noema-Inspired SOTA: Dilated DSConv with Cross-Half Bilinear Pooling (No-PE) | Aetheria I | 62 | 0.6658 | 0.8502 | 0.0434 | 0.4633 | 0.9128 | 0.9503 |\
