    \n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 136 | 1 | No-PE + Gated Second-Order Residual (alpha=0.2, temp=2.0, r=4, gate_bias=-3) | Noema I | 75 | 0.6685 | 0.8528 | 0.0365 | 0.4820 | 0.8802 | 0.9514 | 0.5629 | 0.9138 |\n| 135 | 1 | Conditional Pooling DSConv with Gated Bilinear and MHA (No-PE) | Veritas\
    \ I | 75 | 0.6661 | 0.8646 | 0.0727 | 0.4611 | 0.8801 | 0.9523 | 0.5593 | 0.8723 |\n| 134 | 1 | Adaptive Gating for Dual-Path CNN-BiGRU | Episteme I | 73 | 0.6721 | 0.8549 | 0.0795 | 0.4479 | 0.8777 | 0.9488 | 0.5608 | 0.9354 |\n| 133 | 1 | Ablation: Gated Second-Order Pooling (LRB r=8; gate_bias=-4.0; gate=mean only) | Noema I | 73 | 0.6312 | 0.8518 | 0.0384 | 0.4403 | 0.9015 | 0.9495 | 0.5629 | 0.6738 |\n| 132 | 1 | No-PE + Gated Second-Order Pooling (LRB r=8; gate_bias=-2.0; gate=mean+MHA) | Noema I | 73 | 0.6667 | 0.8586 | 0.0541 | 0.4788 | 0.8844 | 0.9509 | 0.5567 | 0.8831 |\n| 131 | 1 | Dual-Pathway Network (DSConv + BiLSTM) with Hybrid Pooling | Veritas I | 73 | 0.2419 | 0.3419 | 0.0344 | 0.3216 | 0.0390 | 0.6372 | 0.1329 | 0.1862 |\n| 130 | 1 | Noema Backbone with Mean-Vector Query Attention Pooling (No-PE) | Aetheria I | 72 | 0.6299 | 0.7081 | 0.0540 | 0.4769 | 0.8801 | 0.9497 | 0.5607 | 0.7800 |\n| 129 | 1 | Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Noema's MHA Pooling (No-PE) | Veritas I\
    \ | 71 | 0.6673 | 0.8538 | 0.0471 | 0.4852 | 0.8972 | 0.9507 | 0.5603 | 0.8769 |\n| 128 | 1 | Precise Noema SOTA Replication: Dilated DSConv with Learned Query MHA (No-PE, GELU, GradClip) | Aetheria I | 69 | 0.6649 | 0.8512 | 0.0408 | 0.4472 | 0.8856 | 0.9516 | 0.5684 | 0.9092 |\n| 127 | 1 | Tuned Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention (Reduced LR) | Veritas I | 69 | 0.6733 | 0.8583 | 0.0630 | 0.4938 | 0.8801 | 0.9503 | 0.5584 | 0.9092 |\n\nPage 1 of 14 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-14, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an\
