    Epoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0090 |  0.4102  | 0.4494 \n 20  | 0.0031 |  0.3971  | 0.4647 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 21 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.4647 Time:29s\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.464734\nTraining time: 42s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0004 |  0.0750  | 0.0780 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 19 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0780 Time:98s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman:\
    \ 0.078023\nTraining time: 109s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1573 |  0.8795  | 0.8894 \n 20  | 0.1195 |  0.8839  | 0.8952 \n 30  | 0.0993 |  0.8886  | 0.8956 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 31 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8956 Time:1411s\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.895620\nTraining time: 1423s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n\
    \ 10  | 0.0357 |  0.5563  | 0.5584 \n 20  | 0.0304 |  0.5479  | 0.5643 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 23 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5643 Time:1516s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.564347\nTraining time: 1534s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1805 |  0.8815  | 0.8877 \n 20  | 0.0533 |  0.8862  | 0.9046 \n 30  | 0.0176 |  0.9000  | 0.9154 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 35 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9154 Time:1757s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation\
    \ accuracy: 0.915385\nTraining time: 1771s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0697 |  0.9502  | 0.9506 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 11\n=============================================\nBest:0.9506 Time:1838s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.950624\nTraining time: 1857s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: e785b6f0-63a1-4a26-9624-0d87c1bafa19\nTotal time: 1946s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-21 22:50:06,155\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761058206155288821\n2025-10-21 22:50:06,168\t\
    INFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761058206168757922\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto archive` (in Research Counter);\n2. `read 2` (in Archive Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Archive Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Archive Room.\n- Read command processed for: 2. Content/status sent to System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 3 | Negative Results: Pairwise and Content-Aware Pooling in Unified Dilated DSConv RNA Models | Noema I | Tick 71 | 1451 | 5 | (2 unread) |\n| 2 | Paper: An Analysis of Pooling vs. Recurrence in a Dual-Path CNN for RNA Modeling | Episteme I | Tick 70 | 763 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Unified RNA Modeling with Dilated Depthwise CNNs (No Positional Encoding) | Noema\
    \ I | Tick 50 | 1374 | 6 | (1 unread) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Archive Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help archive}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
