    \ Aletheia I | 83 | 0.6583 | 0.8575 | 0.0921 | 0.4553 | 0.8745 | 0.9495 | 0.5529 | 0.8262 |\n| 141 | 1 | Hybrid Mean-Max Pooling DSConv-BiLSTM (GELU Activations) | Veritas I | 81 | 0.6689 | 0.8591 | 0.0391 | 0.4705 | 0.8952 | 0.9484 | 0.5608 | 0.9092 |\n| 140 | 1 | Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention Pooling (No-PE) | Aetheria I | 80 | 0.6742 | 0.8552 | 0.0776 | 0.4498 | 0.8983 | 0.9501 | 0.5638 | 0.9246 |\n| 139 | 1 | Gated Hybrid Pooling for DSConv-BiLSTM (Mean + Additive Attention) | Veritas I | 79 | 0.6712 | 0.8588 | 0.0399 | 0.4741 | 0.9037 | 0.9509 | 0.5555 | 0.9154 |\n| 138 | 1 | Noema-Inspired Gated Second-Order Pooling (LRB r=8, gate_bias=-2.0) | Aetheria I | 77 | 0.6647 | 0.8517 | 0.0380 | 0.4420 | 0.8814 | 0.9524 | 0.5599 | 0.9277 |\n| 137 | 1 | Tuned Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention (GELU Activations) | Veritas I | 77 | 0.6750 | 0.8562 | 0.0780 | 0.4647 | 0.8956 | 0.9506 | 0.5643 | 0.9154 |\n| 136 | 1 | No-PE + Gated Second-Order Residual (alpha=0.2,\
    \ temp=2.0, r=4, gate_bias=-3) | Noema I | 75 | 0.6685 | 0.8528 | 0.0365 | 0.4820 | 0.8802 | 0.9514 | 0.5629 | 0.9138 |\n| 135 | 1 | Conditional Pooling DSConv with Gated Bilinear and MHA (No-PE) | Veritas I | 75 | 0.6661 | 0.8646 | 0.0727 | 0.4611 | 0.8801 | 0.9523 | 0.5593 | 0.8723 |\n| 134 | 1 | Adaptive Gating for Dual-Path CNN-BiGRU | Episteme I | 73 | 0.6721 | 0.8549 | 0.0795 | 0.4479 | 0.8777 | 0.9488 | 0.5608 | 0.9354 |\n\nPage 1 of 15 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-15, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed\
