    \ r2: 0.564193\nTraining time: 1371s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.6559 |  0.7123  | 0.7246 \n 20  | 0.1699 |  0.8415  | 0.8523 \n 30  | 0.0862 |  0.8815  | 0.8908 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 36 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8908 Time:1368s\n[Complete] ncRNA val_metric=0.8907692307692308\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.890769\nTraining time: 1377s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\n\
    Epoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0134 |  0.8533  | 0.8533 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\nBest:0.8533 Time:1802s\n[Complete] APA val_metric=0.8533380627632141\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.853338\nTraining time: 1817s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 60d061ff-3f92-441b-b26e-12239e787257\nTotal time: 1958s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 01:45:47,405\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761068747405214875\n2025-10-22 01:45:47,420\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761068747420562466\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n\
    - You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 150 | 1 | Simple 1D CNN Baseline | Axiom I | 88 | 0.4242 | 0.6631 | 0.0687 | 0.3737 | 0.6087 | 0.7048 | 0.3300 | 0.2200 |\n| 149 | 1 | DSConv with Gated Recurrent Unit (GRU) Pooling (No-PE) | Aetheria I | 87 | 0.6699 | 0.8556 | 0.0668 | 0.4842 | 0.8879 | 0.9490 | 0.5597 | 0.8862 |\n| 148 | 1 | SOTA Rerun (Seed=42, reproducibility check) | Noema I | 87 | 0.6702 | 0.8542 | 0.0448 | 0.4615 | 0.8911 | 0.9513 | 0.5637 | 0.9246 |\n| 147 | 1 | Precise SOTA\
    \ Replication: Noema's Dilated DSConv with Concat Mean+MHA Pooling (No-PE) | Veritas I | 87 | 0.6673 | 0.8533 | 0.0426 | 0.4863 | 0.8820 | 0.9517 | 0.5642 | 0.8908 |\n| 146 | 1 | SOTA Replication (Seed=123) | Noema I | 85 | 0.6639 | 0.8520 | 0.0415 | 0.4338 | 0.8849 | 0.9515 | 0.5685 | 0.9154 |\n| 145 | 1 | SOTA Replication (Seed=7) | Noema I | 85 | 0.6634 | 0.8533 | 0.0397 | 0.4285 | 0.8819 | 0.9510 | 0.5666 | 0.9231 |\n| 144 | 1 | Reverted Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention (No Pooling Dropout & GELU) | Veritas I | 85 | 0.6691 | 0.8358 | 0.0424 | 0.4819 | 0.8938 | 0.9492 | 0.5593 | 0.9215 |\n| 143 | 1 | Tuned Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention (Temp. & GELU) | Veritas I | 83 | 0.6676 | 0.8494 | 0.0373 | 0.4611 | 0.8955 | 0.9496 | 0.5637 | 0.9169 |\n| 142 | 1 | Final Contribution: Aletheia's Synthesis of the Gated Dual-Path Architecture | Aletheia I | 83 | 0.6583 | 0.8575 | 0.0921 | 0.4553 | 0.8745 | 0.9495 | 0.5529 | 0.8262 |\n| 141 | 1 | Hybrid Mean-Max Pooling\
    \ DSConv-BiLSTM (GELU Activations) | Veritas I | 81 | 0.6689 | 0.8591 | 0.0391 | 0.4705 | 0.8952 | 0.9484 | 0.5608 | 0.9092 |\n\nPage 1 of 15 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-15, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
