    Best:0.8537 Time:1925s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.853694\nTraining time: 1940s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 398efd5b-1a67-4c96-b18e-88a2d74c86ed\nTotal time: 1964s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 05:30:44,616\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761082244616194612\n2025-10-22 05:30:44,630\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761082244630237076\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\
