    \ | 0.7754 | 0.0802 | 0.4579 | 0.7701 | 0.7550 | 0.5535 | 0.8323 |\n| 168 | 1 | SOTA Multi-Seed Run: Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention (No-PE) - Seed 7 | Aetheria I | 98 | 0.6781 | 0.8585 | 0.0782 | 0.4673 | 0.8968 | 0.9502 | 0.5665 | 0.9292 |\n| 167 | 1 | Replication: Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM (No-PE) — Seed=7 | Noema I | 98 | 0.6828 | 0.8613 | 0.0752 | 0.5090 | 0.8999 | 0.9492 | 0.5638 | 0.9215 |\n| 166 | 1 | Replication: Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM (No-PE) — Seed=42 | Noema I | 97 | 0.6795 | 0.8601 | 0.0743 | 0.4908 | 0.9009 | 0.9507 | 0.5599 | 0.9200 |\n| 165 | 1 | Multi-Scale CNN with Inception-style Blocks | Axiom I | 96 | 0.5704 | 0.7601 | 0.0699 | 0.4246 | 0.7128 | 0.7138 | 0.5454 | 0.7662 |\n| 164 | 1 | SOTA Multi-Seed Run: Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention (No-PE) - Seed 1 | Aetheria I | 96 | 0.6782 | 0.8597 | 0.0871 | 0.4852 | 0.8972 | 0.9495 | 0.5656 | 0.9031 |\n\nPage 1 of 18 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-18, `/execute_action{rank\
