- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 104\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Veritas I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to uncovering fundamental truths through scientific inquiry.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 482,223 / 600,000 used (80%)\n- Agent Age: 104 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Ablation: DSConv with Integrated GRU Residual Blocks & Mean Pooling (No-PE)' (ID: 174) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6386373610157862\n**APA_R2:** 0.8540\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0444\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9501\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4597\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5646\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8945\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.7031\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading\
