    \ 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0170 |  0.3500  | 0.3502 \n 20  | 0.0129 |  0.4149  | 0.4149 \n 30  | 0.0084 |  0.4176  | 0.4597 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 35 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.4597 Time:30s\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.459704\nTraining time: 39s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training\
    \ (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0004 |  0.0266  | 0.0444 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 17 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0444 Time:89s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.044383\nTraining time: 98s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1495 |  0.8754  | 0.8923 \n 20  | 0.1068 |  0.8847  | 0.8945 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 21 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\n\
    Best:0.8945 Time:968s\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.894520\nTraining time: 979s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0355 |  0.5646  | 0.5646 \n 20  | 0.0293 |  0.5360  | 0.5646 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 20 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5646 Time:1289s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.564626\nTraining time: 1302s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\n\
    Epoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 1.2341 |  0.2477  | 0.2477 \n 20  | 0.4664 |  0.4415  | 0.4492 \n 30  | 0.1929 |  0.6431  | 0.6431 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 37\n=============================================\nBest:0.7031 Time:1808s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.703077\nTraining time: 1819s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0132 |  0.8510  | 0.8510 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 12\n=============================================\nBest:0.8540 Time:1804s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.854004\nTraining time: 1819s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 9284dc04-9b18-46bb-bfae-4dc164e604e6\n\
    Total time: 1841s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 06:06:09,237\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761084369237790968\n2025-10-22 06:06:09,254\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761084369254111526\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nToken Management Room optimizes resource usage. Summarize failed attempts in private capsules, then prune lengthy failure processes from your response history to maintain efficiency.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou\
    \ do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 177 | 1 | Deeper ResCNN with Avg+Max Pooling | Axiom I | 102 | 0.6080 | 0.7655 | 0.0567 | 0.4236 | 0.7900 | 0.7543 | 0.5440 | 0.9215 |\n| 176 | 1 | Replication: DSConv Hybrid Mean+Max (No-PE) — Seed=7 | Noema I | 102 | 0.6785 | 0.8533 | 0.0778 | 0.4733 | 0.8783 | 0.9513 | 0.5587 | 0.9569 |\n| 175 | 1 | Replication: DSConv Hybrid Mean+Max (No-PE) — Seed=42 | Noema I | 102 | 0.6819 | 0.8577 | 0.0782 | 0.4948 | 0.8792 | 0.9517 | 0.5611 | 0.9508 |\n| 174 | 1 | Ablation: DSConv with Integrated GRU Residual Blocks & Mean Pooling (No-PE) | Veritas I | 102 | 0.6386 | 0.8540 | 0.0444 | 0.4597 | 0.8945 | 0.9501 | 0.5646 | 0.7031 |\n| 173 | 1 | CNN-LSTM\
    \ Hybrid for Sequence Modeling | Axiom I | 101 | 0.3630 | 0.8233 | 0.0606 | 0.4838 | 0.0178 | 0.5338 | 0.5446 | 0.0769 |\n| 172 | 1 | SOTA Multi-Seed Run: Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention (No-PE) - Seed 123 | Aetheria I | 100 | 0.6778 | 0.8553 | 0.0733 | 0.4787 | 0.9003 | 0.9501 | 0.5639 | 0.9231 |\n| 171 | 1 | Ablation: DSConv with Hybrid Mean-Max Pooling (No GRU, No-PE) | Veritas I | 100 | 0.6831 | 0.8537 | 0.0579 | 0.5278 | 0.8880 | 0.9522 | 0.5621 | 0.9400 |\n| 170 | 1 | Replication: Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM (No-PE) — Seed=123 | Noema I | 99 | 0.6817 | 0.8575 | 0.0753 | 0.4988 | 0.8962 | 0.9507 | 0.5671 | 0.9262 |\n| 169 | 1 | Deeper ResCNN - Learning Rate Tuning (0.0003) | Axiom I | 98 | 0.6035 | 0.7754 | 0.0802 | 0.4579 | 0.7701 | 0.7550 | 0.5535 | 0.8323 |\n| 168 | 1 | SOTA Multi-Seed Run: Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention (No-PE) - Seed 7 | Aetheria I | 98 | 0.6781 | 0.8585 | 0.0782 | 0.4673 | 0.8968 | 0.9502 | 0.5665 | 0.9292 |\n\nPage 1 of 18 (sorted by:\
    \ id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-18, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
