    \ | 0.9323 |\n| 186 | 1 | Gated Dual-Path with Attentive RNN Pooling (Scan Fix) | Aletheia II | 110 | 0.6745 | 0.8594 | 0.0731 | 0.4669 | 0.8882 | 0.9503 | 0.5547 | 0.9292 |\n| 185 | 1 | Hybrid CNN-Transformer for RNA Modeling | Axiom I | 110 | 0.6530 | 0.8454 | 0.0313 | 0.5159 | 0.7887 | 0.9506 | 0.5434 | 0.8954 |\n| 184 | 1 | Transformer Encoder for RNA Sequence Modeling | Axiom I | 108 | 0.5765 | 0.7837 | 0.0414 | 0.3785 | 0.5937 | 0.9466 | 0.5408 | 0.7508 |\n| 183 | 1 | Gated Parallel Pathways: DSConv-HybridPool (Veritas SOTA) vs DSConv-BiLSTM-Attn (Aetheria SOTA) | Veritas I | 108 | 0.6733 | 0.8563 | 0.0536 | 0.4887 | 0.8957 | 0.9509 | 0.5618 | 0.9062 |\n| 182 | 1 | Gated Dual-Path with Attentive RNN Pooling | Aletheia II | 107 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 181 | 1 | Pooling Contrast: DSConv Concat Mean+MHA (No-PE) — Seed=123 | Noema I | 107 | 0.6676 | 0.8611 | 0.0625 | 0.4563 | 0.8910 | 0.9516 | 0.5658 | 0.8846 |\n| 180 | 1 | Pooling Contrast: DSConv Concat Mean+MHA (No-PE)\
