    \nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.952451\nTraining time: 1907s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: d31daf15-b36e-4e62-b48a-36714f709abb\nTotal time: 1910s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 08:01:03,270\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761091263270303884\n2025-10-22 08:01:03,284\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761091263284493254\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 187` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 187 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\
