    \ | 0.0657 | 0.5116 | 0.8932 | 0.9525 | 0.5621 | 0.9323 |\n| 186 | 1 | Gated Dual-Path with Attentive RNN Pooling (Scan Fix) | Aletheia II | 110 | 0.6745 | 0.8594 | 0.0731 | 0.4669 | 0.8882 | 0.9503 | 0.5547 | 0.9292 |\n| 185 | 1 | Hybrid CNN-Transformer for RNA Modeling | Axiom I | 110 | 0.6530 | 0.8454 | 0.0313 | 0.5159 | 0.7887 | 0.9506 | 0.5434 | 0.8954 |\n\nPage 1 of 20 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-20, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view\
