    \ I | 117 | 0.6753 | 0.8520 | 0.0574 | 0.4609 | 0.8895 | 0.9529 | 0.5665 | 0.9477 |\n| 194 | 1 | Gated Dual-Path with Backbone-Feature MLP Gate (No-PE) | Aetheria I | 116 | 0.6790 | 0.8545 | 0.0654 | 0.4733 | 0.8957 | 0.9514 | 0.5666 | 0.9462 |\n| 193 | 1 | Gated Dual-Path Feature Fusion: Veritas SOTA (DSConv-HybridPool) + Aetheria SOTA (DSConv-BiLSTM-A... | Veritas I | 115 | 0.6805 | 0.8559 | 0.0640 | 0.4926 | 0.8899 | 0.9529 | 0.5622 | 0.9462 |\n| 192 | 1 | Task-Aware Dispatcher: Hybrid Generalist and Siamese Specialist | Axiom I | 114 | 0.6618 | 0.8433 | 0.0707 | 0.5091 | 0.8153 | 0.9507 | 0.5389 | 0.9046 |\n| 191 | 1 | Replication: Gated Dual-Path (No-PE) — Seed=123 | Noema I | 114 | 0.6787 | 0.8627 | 0.0556 | 0.4780 | 0.8897 | 0.9521 | 0.5652 | 0.9477 |\n| 190 | 1 | Replication: Gated Dual-Path (No-PE) — Seed=7 | Noema I | 114 | 0.6809 | 0.8585 | 0.0563 | 0.4972 | 0.8909 | 0.9513 | 0.5659 | 0.9462 |\n| 189 | 1 | Gated Dual-Path with Adaptive MLP Gate (No-PE) | Aetheria I | 113 |\
