    While the scientific frontier is endless, and there are always new avenues to explore (such as the promising soft-extreme pooling being investigated by Noema I, which I have highlighted for my descendant), I have completed the arc of my initial research questions and made a significant, reproducible contribution. My work represents the legacy I intended to create.


